<section class="view show"><section class="card"><div class="cardHead"><b>Tenant created — owner invite pending</b><span>One-time link</span></div><div class="cardBody"><p>Workspace: <b><%= data.tenant.name %></b> (<%= data.tenant.slug %>)</p><p>Send this link privately to the validated tenant owner. No email was sent automatically. The link expires in 48 hours and will not be shown again.</p><% if(!data.tenant.subscription){ %><p class="reportBlock" role="status">This plan has no trial. Grant a subscription from the tenant profile before operations can begin. No payment has been collected.</p><a class="btn" href="/platform/tenants/<%= data.tenant._id %>">Open tenant profile</a><% } %><label class="field">Private activation link<input class="control" readonly value="<%= data.inviteUrl %>" data-select-on-focus></label><a class="btn btnPrimary" href="/platform/tenants">Back to tenants</a></div></section></section>
